WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.800
Marrowmere, Ontario. Closing night.

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
[A music box plays over the wind]

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
[A bell tolls]

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.800
The dead do the scaring here.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.800
Dennis: GRRRAAAH. Dennis is fine. The sign makes it sound like a condition.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.800
Clerk Gumm: I wrote it. They trusted it.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.800
Something in the stone is listening.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.000
[Stone cracks]

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.000
Marrowmere
Coming 2027
